{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And you</b> — the second word is a construct link, as in <i>ולא עשו עם בית ירובעל גדעון</i> (Judges 8:35)." "<b>The meaning of צעיר</b> — that it is small." "<b>From you</b> — all this is on account of David, who is the head of the kingship. Therefore <i>ומוצאותיו מקדם</i> (his goings forth are from of old) — concerning David. And he is speaking to Bethlehem Ephrathah: for from your earliest descendants a savior to Israel shall come."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:09.196081548Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}